  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.34,
      "text": "Sports are more fun with a point of view."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.96,
      "end": 5.84,
      "text": "Player prop and fantasy research can feel like noise,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.56,
      "end": 9.46,
      "text": "too many tabs, too many takes, too little context."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.68,
      "end": 14.08,
      "text": "Meet Propeller Pics, an I-assisted research workspace"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.08,
      "end": 16.62,
      "text": "for sports fans who want to clear a way in."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.32,
      "end": 20.42,
      "text": "What is it, a place to explore a player, a line,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.74,
      "end": 22.22,
      "text": "and the context around both?"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.24,
      "end": 25.74,
      "text": "Start free in the Propeller Analyzer on the web,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.48,
      "end": 28.2,
      "text": "go deeper on web or mobile."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.9,
      "end": 32.58,
      "text": "Use it before the slate when news changes the picture"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.58,
      "end": 34.82,
      "text": "or whenever you want a second look."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.76,
      "end": 38.26,
      "text": "Propeller brings together sport-specific signals,"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.68,
      "end": 42.16,
      "text": "role, matchup, recent form, game environment,"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.66,
      "end": 44.1,
      "text": "injuries, and market context."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.26,
      "end": 48.32,
      "text": "It turns that research into a clear directional read."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.18,
      "end": 51.8,
      "text": "Confidence shows how strongly the available signals"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.8,
      "end": 53.24,
      "text": "support more or less."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.02,
      "end": 55.9,
      "text": "It is context, not a guarantee."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.86,
      "end": 59.12,
      "text": "Want to know why? Open the breakdown."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.02,
      "end": 63.0,
      "text": "Inspect the line, direction, and signals behind the read."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.18,
      "end": 67.2,
      "text": "For MLB fantasy research, see a hitter's floor,"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.6,
      "end": 68.98,
      "text": "central projection, and ceiling."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.2,
      "end": 74.24,
      "text": "No sportsbook, no entries placed, just a smarter starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.28,
      "end": 78.88,
      "text": "Less tab hopping, more context, more ways to enjoy the game."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.98,
      "end": 82.82,
      "text": "Propeller Pics, start free at Propeller Picscom."
    }
  ],
